0\xa0EUROSNIVEL B: 55\xa0EUROS'}, 'source': 'FlowteTaquillaCultural', 'exec_time': '20260303T092150', 'session': '2026_03_03_09_15_Martes', 'image': 'https://www.flowte.me/cabinet/event/img/36733-1763723396.6461.png', 'url': 'https://www.flowte.me/storefront/almeria-cultura-401?cc'}
